MAIN
MOVE TEMP 16 4
MOVE TEMP 17 HALLOCATE TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 4
MOVE TEMP 19 HALLOCATE TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 20 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 21 RecurAccum_ved_TestRecurAccum
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 21
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 2 0
MOVE TEMP 22 CALL TEMP 3 ( TEMP 0 )
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 22
PRINT TEMP 4
END
RecurAccum_ved_TestRecurAccum [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 23 4
MOVE TEMP 24 HALLOCATE TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 25 4
MOVE TEMP 26 HALLOCATE TEMP 25
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 26
MOVE TEMP 27 TEMP 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 TEMP 27
MOVE TEMP 28 Summer_ved_SumUpTo
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 29 5
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 29
MOVE TEMP 30 0
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 30
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 1 0
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 0
MOVE TEMP 31 CALL TEMP 8 ( TEMP 1 TEMP 5 TEMP 6 )
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 31
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 9
PRINT TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 32 10
MOVE TEMP 10 TEMP 32
MOVE TEMP 33 0
MOVE TEMP 11 TEMP 33
HLOAD TEMP 12 TEMP 1 0
HLOAD TEMP 13 TEMP 12 0
MOVE TEMP 34 CALL TEMP 13 ( TEMP 1 TEMP 10 TEMP 11 )
MOVE TEMP 14 TEMP 34
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 14
PRINT TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 35 0
MOVE TEMP 15 TEMP 35

RETURN TEMP 15
END
Summer_ved_SumUpTo [ 3 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 36 0
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 36
MOVE TEMP 37 LE TEMP 1 TEMP 4
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 37
CJUMP TEMP 5 L1
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 2
JUMP L2
L1  NOOP
MOVE TEMP 38 1
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 38
MOVE TEMP 39 MINUS TEMP 1 TEMP 6
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 39
MOVE TEMP 40 PLUS TEMP 2 TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 40
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 9 0
MOVE TEMP 41 CALL TEMP 10 ( TEMP 0 TEMP 7 TEMP 8 )
MOVE TEMP 11 TEMP 41
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 11
L2  NOOP

RETURN TEMP 3
END

